From 27f3f5770adb1cefd7c2643830116e3c7fd33bd9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mornica-spotify-bot <spotify-grade-bot@shadowspark.local>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:46:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(mornica-spotify): home feed, search, downloads and
 settings overlays
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Phase B browse shell on top of Phase A:
- HomeFeedScreen (recommender shelves), SearchScreen (local library filter), DownloadsScreen
  (rights-gated catalog states; only offlineAllowed tracks expose download), SettingsScreen
  (Wi-Fi-only toggle through router; privacy policy deep link; no new permissions)
- ShelfComponents (SectionHeader/ShelfRow/TrackRowCompact/GenreChip/EmptyStateCard) using existing tokens
- MornicaApp: MornicaNav overlay route holder; Back closes overlay first; overflow menu entries;
  PrimaryScreen.entries untouched (accessibility test safe)
- MainActivity: SharedPrefsPlaylistStore + recommender history sink

Status: static-verified; testDebugUnitTest/lintDebug/assembleDebug and device smoke UNVERIFIED here
(no Android SDK in this environment) — run scripts/verify.sh + emulator proof on owner machine.
